    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Painting of two people with a red parasol on a flower-covered cliff overlooking a blue-green sea with sailboats and a cloudy sky.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting depicts a coastal view from a high vantage point. In the right foreground, a grassy, flower-dotted cliff edge slopes down toward the sea. Two figures stand near the top of the cliff: one holds a bright red parasol, and both wear long, light-toned dresses. The sea stretches across the middle ground, animated by short, directional brushstrokes in blues, greens, whites, and grays, with numerous small white-sailed boats scattered across its surface. The sky above is predominantly blue with soft, white cloud formations. The entire surface shows visible texture from thick paint application, especially in the foreground vegetation.",
